  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Nelson Costa. Calling about a streetlight out by a crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where's the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-nine Rhode Island Avenue. Right in front, on Historic Hill. Whole crosswalk is dark at night. Don't feel safe crossing there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the light's out over the crosswalk at 409 Rhode Island Avenue. Do you know if it's the pole in front or the one next to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Pole in front, I think. Closest one to the crosswalk. Can you send a crew to check the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in the request for a crew to look at it. Is it totally out or flickering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally out. Been dark a few nights now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, writing that down. Totally out, few nights, crosswalk. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:17:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just, today's trash day on the street. Truck just went by, so crew won't be blocked by cans or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, thanks. Want a callback number on this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:17:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:17:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-six. All set, Nelson."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
